                       * table SED "QSO.sed"                                                             *
                       * no line transfer                                                                *
                       * nuL(nu) = 44.5 at 1 Ryd                                                         *
                       * stop temperature off                                                            *
                       * metals 0.001                                                                    *
                       * save last radius ".rad"                                                         *
                       * save last continuum ".cont"                                                     *
